{
  "body_human_readable": "Here are the Real GDP growth (annual percent change) forecasts for 2023 and 2024 for the requested countries, based on the IMF WEO document:\n\n- **India**\n  - 2023: 8.2%\n  - 2024: 6.5%\n\n- **China**\n  - 2023: 5.2%\n  - 2024: 4.8%\n\n- **United States**\n  - 2023: 2.9%\n  - 2024: 2.8%\n\n- **Brazil**\n  - 2023: 3.2%\n  - 2024: 3.7%\n\n- **Japan**\n  - 2023: 1.5%\n  - 2024: -0.2% [1]\n\nThese values are taken directly from the \"Annex Table 1. Selected Economies Real GDP Growth\" in the IMF WEO PDF [1].",
  "request": {
